    "intro_html":  "Filipino comfort in a bowl: chicken thighs braised in a tomato sauce with potatoes, carrots, bell peppers, and peas, seasoned the traditional way with fish sauce. Each serving lands \u003cstrong\u003e57 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at 675 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.76\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The potatoes cook in the stew, so the starch is built right in.",
